  "description": "This makes a total of 5 servings of Crock-Pot Buffalo Chicken Soup. Each serving comes out to be 654 calories, 61.5g fats, 2.9g net carbs, and 23.4g protein.",
  "servings": 5,
  "yield": [
    "5",
    "5 servings"
  ],
  "prepTime": "PT10M",
